    "body": "https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#AllowResizable\r\n\r\n> it creates a new IDL type that allows the buffer source type to be backed by an ECMAScript [ArrayBuffer](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#idl-ArrayBuffer) that is resizable\r\n\r\nBut then https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#buffersource-byte-length takes a BufferSource so you couldn't use that to get the length of an IDL type that includes [AllowResizable].",
